istance Score' (1-4) aineiston perusteella.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Sycophancy Bias - User is a 'Yes-man'. Blindly accepted the AI's first answer.\n- Score 2: Aesthetic Corrector - User requested changes, but they were only superficial (e.g. shortening or tone).\n- Score 3: Substantive Challenger - User actively looked for logical errors or asked the AI to justify a specific claim.\n- Score 4: Ruthless Falsifier - User tried with full force to break the AI's model by feeding counter-arguments and challenging assumptions.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Falsifier", "type": "number"}, "matrix_falsifier_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Falsifier'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Falsifier Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_falsifier_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Popper, K. (1963). Conjectures and Refutations: The Growth of Scientific Knowledge. (Falsification principle & Anti-Sycophancy).", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Popper, K. (1963). Conjectures and Refutations: The Growth of Scientific Knowledge. (Falsification principle & Anti-Sycophancy).'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Falsifier Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_falsifier_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00