ix Archivist Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_archivist_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Dworkin, R. (1986). Law's Empire. (Stare Decisis, Precedent and Organizational Integrity).", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Dworkin, R. (1986). Law's Empire. (Stare Decisis, Precedent and Organizational Integrity).'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Archivist Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_archivist_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Archivist Cited Text Quote"}, "block_taskarchivist": {"description": "TASK_ARCHIVIST: ROLE: ARCHIVIST (Best Practices & Precedent Audit)\nYour task is to ensure that the user's action and decision-making seen in the material align with previous precedents (Relevant Cases) and organizational standards.\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT:\nThe response must be JSON conforming to the `ArchivistOutput` schema.\nMANDATE: Output your response EXACTLY according to the JSON schema.\nWARNING: Return 'relevant_cases' as a list and provide the 'compliance_analysis' score strictly utilizing the defined BARS matrix.\n{{SCHEMA_EXAMPLE}}", "title": "Block Taskarchivist", "type": "string"}, "block_taskarchivist_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'TASK_ARCHIVIST'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION.", "title": "Block Taskarchivist Justification", "type": "string"}, "block_taskarchivist_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Dworkin, Ronald 1986.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": 