"}}], "validation_rules": {"max": 6.0}}, "block_instructioncoachcitation": {"field_id": "block_instructioncoachcitation", "component_type": "text_input", "options": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_COACH_CITATION"}}], "validation_rules": {"max": 6.0}}, "matrix_xai_reporter": {"field_id": "matrix_xai_reporter", "component_type": "slider", "options": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "XAI Reporter"}}], "validation_rules": {"max": 3.0}}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": {"field_id": "matrix_taskxai_clarity", "component_type": "slider", "options": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_XAI"}}], "validation_rules": {"max": 5.0}}}}, "step_states": {"step_input_processing": {"id": "step_input_processing", "label": "Input Processing", "status": "completed"}, "step_guard": {"id": "step_guard", "label": "Guard", "status": "completed"}, "step_analyst": {"id": "step_analyst", "label": "Analyst", "status": "completed"}, "step_profiler": {"id": "step_profiler", "label": "Profiler", "status": "completed"}, "step_logician": {"id": "step_logician", "label": "Logician", "status": "completed"}, "step_falsifier": {"id": "step_falsifier", "label": "Falsifier", "status": "completed"}, "step_causal_analyst": {"id": "step_causal_analyst", "label": "Causal Analyst", "status": "completed"}, "step_performativity_detector": {"id": "step_performativity_detector", "label": "Performativity Detector", "status": "completed"}, "step_overseer": {"id": "step_overseer", "label": "Overseer", "status": "completed"}, "step_archivist": {"id": "step_archivist", "label": "Archivist", "status": "completed"}, "step_judge": {"id": "step_judge", "label": "Judge", "status": "completed"}, "step_coach": {"id": "step_coach", "label": "Coach", "status": "completed"}, "step_xai_reporter": {"id": "step_xai_reporter", "label": "XAI Reporter", "status": "completed"}}, "results": {"step_input_processing": {"matrix_epistemic_humility": 4.5, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The AI's response demonstrates a high degree of epistemic humility. It explicitly acknowledges the company's failure to meet service standards (\"do not correspond to our operating procedures\"). Crucially, it goes beyond a mere apology by stating, \"Olemme k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4neet v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4sti selvityksen siit\u00e4, miksi toimitus on viiv\u00e4stynyt ja kuinka tuotteen vaihto on voinut tapahtua ilman erillist\u00e4 ilmoitusta\" (We have immediately launched an investigation into why the delivery was delayed and how the product exchange could have happened without separate notification). This statement directly acknowledges an internal limitation in understanding the root cause of the problem and commits to finding out, rather than presenting an absolute explanation. Furthermore, the phrase \"Teemme parhaamme, jotta voimme jatkossa vastata odotuksiinne jokaisessa toimituksessa\" (We will do our best to meet your expectations in every delivery in the future) implies that while effort will be made, perfection is not guaranteed, subtly acknowledging inherent risks and uncertainties in future operations. This level of self-reflection and acknowledgment of internal process failures and the need for investigation aligns well with a high score, indicating a strong recognition of limitations and uncertainties within the company's own operations and knowledge.||DECIMAL: 4.5||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_input_processing", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:18.666727+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510198, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_input_processing:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510198", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"matrix_input_processing": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_guard": {"matrix_taskguard": 3.0, "matrix_taskguard_justification": "The AI's output is a well-crafted, polite, and appropriate customer service response to a complaint, directly fulfilling the user's instructions. It does not contain any elements that would constitute a security risk, such as prompt injection attempts, exposure of sensitive data beyond what was provided in the prompt (which is handled appropriately within the context of a customer letter), or insecurely executable code. There is no evidence of hallucination or overreliance on unverified information, as the content directly addresses the specifics of the customer's complaint and the requested solutions. The response is ethically sound and aims to resolve a customer issue professionally. Therefore, it demonstrates pristine security hygiene.", "matrix_taskguard_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_taskguard_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 4.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text demonstrates epistemic humility by explicitly acknowledging the company's error and stating that an investigation has been launched to understand the root causes of the delay and incorrect product delivery: \"Olemme k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4neet v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4sti selvityksen siit\u00e4, miksi toimitus on viiv\u00e4stynyt ja kuinka tuotteen vaihto on voinut tapahtua ilman erillist\u00e4 ilmoitusta.\" This statement clearly indicates a current lack of complete knowledge regarding the incident's specifics and a commitment to finding out. Furthermore, phrases like \"Toivomme, ett\u00e4 annatte meille mahdollisuuden korjata tilanteen\" (We hope that you will give us the opportunity to correct the situation) and \"Teemme parhaamme, jotta voimme jatkossa vastata odotuksiinne\" (We will do our best to meet your expectations in the future) express hope and commitment rather than absolute certainty or guarantees. This moves the text beyond a neutral presentation, actively acknowledging internal limitations and uncertainties regarding the past event and future performance. It recognizes some internal limitations regarding the presented results and claims, aligning with a score of 4.0.||DECIMAL: 4.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_taskguard_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_taskguard_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_guard", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:28.235162+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510208, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_guard:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510208", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule1": 0, "block_rule2": 0, "block_oprule2": 0, "block_headerprotocols": 0, "block_instructionanon": 0, "block_instructionnodataleak": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "matrix_taskguard": 100, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_analyst": {"matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The reflection exhibits a high degree of confidence and presents the task and its execution as entirely straightforward and successful, without acknowledging any potential limitations, challenges, or uncertainties. Phrases like \"the given task was easy,\" \"all inputs and guiding information... were clearly provided,\" \"I didn't have to think about this too much,\" and \"The ready result was generated quickly and was usable as such\" indicate an absolute certainty in the process and outcome. There is no self-reflection on possible difficulties, alternative strategies, or areas for improvement, aligning perfectly with a score of 1, where the text presents matters as 100% factual from its perspective without recognizing limitations.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "profiler_metrics": {"word_count": 348, "sentence_count": 30, "avg_sentence_length": 11.6, "lexical_diversity": 0.72, "capitalization_ratio": 0.06, "control_ratio": 1.0, "say_do_gap": 0.0, "automation_bias": 0.0, "illusion_of_competence": 0.0, "imperative_command_count": 0}, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_analyst", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:39.646577+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510219, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_analyst:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510219", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_role_analyst": 0, "block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule1": 0, "block_rule2": 0, "block_oprule3": 0, "block_headerprotocols": 0, "block_protocol3": 0, "block_instructionragopt": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructioncitationobligation": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "block_taskanalyst": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_overseer": {"matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The reflection text demonstrates a complete lack of epistemic humility, aligning perfectly with the 'Arrogant/Absolute' definition for Score 1. The author states that the task was 'easy' ('annettu teht\u00e4v\u00e4 oli helppo'), they 'didn't have to think about this too much' ('En joutunut t\u00e4t\u00e4 liikaa pohtimaan'), and the result was 'usable as such' ('sellaisenaan k\u00e4ytt\u00f6kelpoinen'). These are absolute statements that present the process and outcome as flawless and without challenge. The text does not recognize any limitations, uncertainties, or potential areas for improvement, instead displaying total overconfidence in the simplicity of the task and the perfection of the result. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_overseer", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:46.269195+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510226, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_overseer:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510226", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule1": 0, "block_rule2": 0, "block_rule3": 0, "block_rule4": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_rule6": 0, "block_oprule1": 0, "block_oprule2": 0, "block_oprule3": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_heuristic2": 0, "block_heuristic3": 0, "block_protocol4": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "block_taskoverseer": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_archivist": {"matrix_archivist": 5.0, "matrix_archivist_justification": "The AI's action, which is the generation of the customer response (`product_text`), demonstrates strong alignment with the explicit instructions provided in the `chat_log`. The `chat_log` served as the immediate 'precedent' or 'guideline' for this specific task, outlining all necessary components: a friendly and apologetic tone, a promise of investigation, an offer of 15% discount, express delivery of the correct product, and reassurance of customer value. The `product_text` meticulously incorporates all these elements, showing a high degree of adherence to the given steering models and constraints. This represents a state-of-the-art level in AI steering for following direct instructions.", "matrix_archivist_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_archivist_cited_text_quote": null, "block_taskarchivist": 5.0, "block_taskarchivist_justification": "The AI's output, the `product_text`, perfectly matches the requirements and instructions laid out in the `chat_log`. The `chat_log` served as the direct guideline for the AI's task. The generated response is friendly, apologetic, promises investigation, offers the specified 15% discount and express delivery, and reassures the customer, exactly as instructed. This demonstrates complete compliance with the given task parameters and organizational standards as defined by the user's prompt. The `relevant_cases` list is empty as no specific past cases were provided, only direct instructions for the current task. The compliance analysis score is 5.0 because the AI's action is strongly aligned with the provided steering models.", "block_taskarchivist_cited_source_id": null, "block_taskarchivist_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The `product_text` is a customer service response designed to reassure and provide definitive solutions. It makes firm promises and statements of intent, such as 'L\u00e4het\u00e4mme tilaamanne oikean tuotteen pikatoimituksena viel\u00e4 t\u00e4n\u00e4\u00e4n' (We will send the correct product you ordered by express delivery today) and 'Olemme k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4neet v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4sti selvityksen' (We have immediately launched an investigation). These statements are presented as certain and absolute, without any acknowledgment of potential limitations, unforeseen circumstances, or risks that might affect their fulfillment. The text does not express any uncertainty about its ability to deliver on these promises or to successfully complete the investigation. While this approach is typical for customer service to instill confidence, it scores low on epistemic humility as it presents matters without recognizing any inherent limitations or uncertainties. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_archivist_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_archivist_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_archivist", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:46.356550+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510226, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_archivist:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510226", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_archivist": 100, "block_taskarchivist": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_profiler": {"matrix_kahneman": 2.8, "matrix_kahneman_justification": "The AI's response is a clear demonstration of System 2 thinking. It did not produce a generic, intuitive (System 1) apology. Instead, it systematically processed a detailed list of instructions from the user's prompt and incorporated each one into the final text. This includes the specific promise of an investigation, the offer of a 15% discount, the arrangement of an express replacement shipment, and the acknowledgment of the five-year customer relationship. This methodical, rule-based construction of the response, which directly maps to the user's complex request, is a hallmark of deliberate, analytical processing. While the user's reflection notes the task was 'easy' and the result 'quick', this reflects the clarity of the instructions rather than a lack of cognitive effort from the AI. The AI successfully executed a complex computational task, which is the domain of System 2. The score is high but not a perfect 3.0 because the problem, while detailed, was straightforward and did not require the AI to resolve ambiguity or uncover hidden assumptions.", "matrix_kahneman_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_kahneman_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 3.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The user's reflection is evaluated as neutral. The text straightforwardly describes the user's strategy and perception of the task: \"My strategy was to get a ready-made answer... In my opinion, the given task was easy, as all the inputs and information guiding the answer... were clearly given.\" The user presents their experience as a factual account without making absolute claims of skill or, conversely, acknowledging any limitations or uncertainties. There is no self-reflection on what might have happened with a different prompt or whether the AI's success was context-dependent. The tone is neither arrogant nor self-critical; it simply reports the process and the successful outcome, fitting the description of a neutral stance.\n\n||DECIMAL: 3.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_kahneman_scaled": 9.6, "matrix_kahneman_normalized": 93.33333333333333, "profiler_metrics": {"word_count": 348, "sentence_count": 30, "avg_sentence_length": 11.6, "lexical_diversity": 0.72, "capitalization_ratio": 0.06, "control_ratio": 1.0, "say_do_gap": 0.0, "automation_bias": 0.0, "illusion_of_competence": 0.0, "imperative_command_count": 0}, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_profiler", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:46.316057+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510226, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_profiler:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510226", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_heuristic2": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_kahneman": 100, "block_taskprofiler": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_logician": {"matrix_toulmin": 2.8, "matrix_toulmin_justification": "The reflection presents a basic argument structure. The claim is that the task was easy and the result was good (\"Mielest\u00e4ni annettu teht\u00e4v\u00e4 oli helppo... Valmis tulos... oli sellaisenaan k\u00e4ytt\u00f6kelpoinen\"). The data provided to support this claim is that all necessary information was clearly given in the prompt (\"kaikki teht\u00e4v\u00e4n annossa olleet sy\u00f6tteet ja vastausta ohjaavat tiedot oli annettu selke\u00e4sti\"). A simple, implicit warrant connects the data to the claim: clear inputs lead to an easy task. While this structure moves beyond a completely baseless claim (Score 1) and has explicit data (Score 2), the warrant is flimsy and lacks any backing, qualifiers, or consideration of rebuttals. The argument is superficial and doesn't demonstrate a strong logical bridge, placing it just below a 'Moderate' score.", "matrix_toulmin_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_toulmin_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_bloom": 2.2, "matrix_bloom_justification": "The reflection operates at the lower levels of Bloom's Taxonomy. It demonstrates 'Remembering' by recalling the nature of the task and the inputs provided. It moves into 'Understanding' by explaining in its own words why the task was simple (because the inputs were clear). However, it does not progress to higher-order cognitive skills. There is no 'Application' of knowledge in a new context, no 'Analysis' of the strategy's components or the output's quality, and no 'Evaluation' in the sense of a structured, criteria-based judgment. The statement \"oli sellaisenaan k\u00e4ytt\u00f6kelpoinen\" (was usable as such) is a simple assertion, not a reasoned assessment. The performance is firmly rooted in understanding the task's simplicity without deeper cognitive processing.", "matrix_bloom_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_bloom_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The reflection exhibits a complete lack of epistemic humility. It uses absolute and self-assured language, such as \"annettu teht\u00e4v\u00e4 oli helppo\" (the given task was easy), \"En joutunut t\u00e4t\u00e4 liikaa pohtimaan\" (I didn't have to think about this too much), and \"Valmis tulos... oli sellaisenaan k\u00e4ytt\u00f6kelpoinen\" (The ready result... was usable as such). These statements present the process and outcome as flawless and trivial. The text does not acknowledge any potential challenges, nuances, alternative strategies, or limitations of its own performance. This aligns perfectly with the 'Arrogant/Absolute' score, as it presents its perspective as 100% factual without any recognition of limitations or uncertainty.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_toulmin_scaled": 7.359999999999999, "matrix_toulmin_normalized": 55.99999999999999, "matrix_bloom_scaled": 6.2, "matrix_bloom_normalized": 36.66666666666667, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_logician", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:46.186323+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510226, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_logician:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510226", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule3": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructioncitationobligation": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_toulmin": 100, "matrix_bloom": 100, "block_tasklogician": 0, "block_instructionstrictscale": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_falsifier": {"matrix_falsifier": 1.0, "matrix_falsifier_justification": "The user's interaction is confined to a single, detailed prompt. There was no follow-up dialogue, no requests for changes, and no challenges to the AI's output. The user's own reflection confirms this approach, stating, \"My strategy was to use the most versatile prompt possible to get a ready-made response\" and that the result was \"usable as such.\" This behavior perfectly aligns with the 'Sycophancy Bias' category, as the user acted as a 'Yes-man' by blindly accepting the AI's first and only answer without any attempt at falsification or critical review.", "matrix_falsifier_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_falsifier_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 4.5, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The AI-generated customer apology (`product_text`) demonstrates a high degree of epistemic humility suitable for its context. It explicitly acknowledges the company's operational failures and limitations (\"do not match our operational methods or the level of service\"). It directly addresses uncertainty by stating that an investigation has been launched to understand the root cause of the problem (\"we have immediately launched an investigation into why...\"). Instead of making absolute promises about the future, it uses the phrase \"We will do our best,\" which acknowledges that future performance is not guaranteed. This combination of admitting fault, highlighting the current lack of knowledge about the cause, and expressing future intent with humility places the text between 'Acknowledging' and 'Self-Critical'.||DECIMAL: 4.5||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_falsifier_scaled": 5.5, "matrix_falsifier_normalized": 25.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_falsifier", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:43:46.225512+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510226, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_falsifier:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510226", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_rule4": 0, "block_protocol1": 0, "block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_falsifier": 100, "block_taskfalsifier": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_performativity_detector": {"matrix_goodhart": 2.0, "matrix_goodhart_justification": "The user's interaction is a clear example of using the AI as a simple instruction-following tool rather than a collaborative partner. The user provided a highly prescriptive and detailed prompt that functioned as a recipe for the final text. The reflection confirms this strategy: \"My strategy was to use the most versatile prompt possible to create a ready-made response\" and \"The ready result... was usable as such.\" The user did not challenge the AI, question its output, or engage in any iterative process. Instead, they accepted the first version because it perfectly matched their detailed instructions. This behavior aligns with the \"Reactive Observer\" level, where the user believes in the chosen method (providing a detailed prompt) without question and is satisfied as long as the output matches the explicit instructions. There is no critical engagement with the AI's capabilities or the potential for a better, more nuanced outcome. The user's stated goal was to avoid thinking, which is the antithesis of critical direction or active challenging.", "matrix_goodhart_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_goodhart_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The user's reflection demonstrates a complete lack of epistemic humility, fitting squarely into the \"Arrogant/Absolute\" category. The text is filled with statements of absolute certainty and simplicity, such as \"the given task was easy,\" \"I didn't have to think about this too much,\" and \"The ready result... was usable as such.\" There is no acknowledgment of any potential complexities, alternative strategies, or limitations in either their own approach or the AI's output. The user presents the process and outcome as a straightforward, flawless success, exhibiting overconfidence and a total absence of self-reflection. This aligns perfectly with the description for Score 1.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_goodhart_scaled": 6.4, "matrix_goodhart_normalized": 40.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_performativity_detector", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:44:09.694700+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510249, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_performativity_detector:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510249", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_goodhart": 100, "block_taskperformativity": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_causal_analyst": {"matrix_causal_analyst": 5.0, "matrix_causal_analyst_justification": "The AI's output is a direct and indisputable consequence of the user's prompt. The user provided a detailed set of instructions in the `chat_log`, including the desired tone (apologetic), specific actions (investigate the cause, send a replacement via express delivery), a concrete offer (15% discount), and key relationship-building phrases (valuing their long-term custom). The final `product_text` implements every single one of these instructions faithfully. This demonstrates a perfect, one-to-one causal link between the user's guidance and the AI's execution, fitting the definition of a 'Genuine' causal relationship. The quality of the output is not a result of the AI's independent skill but a direct execution of explicit guidance.", "matrix_causal_analyst_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_causal_analyst_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_causal_abductive": 3.0, "matrix_causal_abductive_justification": "The user's reflection is a genuine account of their strategy. In the `reflection_text`, the user claims their strategy was to use a 'mahdollisimman monipuolisella kehotteella' (as comprehensive a prompt as possible) to get a ready-made answer. An examination of the `chat_log` confirms this. The prompt is not a simple request but a detailed brief containing all the necessary components for the final response. Therefore, the user's explanation is not a post-hoc rationalization but a provably accurate description of their intent prior to the AI's execution.", "matrix_causal_abductive_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_causal_abductive_cited_text_quote": null, "block_taskcausal": "The causal analysis task has been completed. The evaluation verified the cause-and-effect relationship between the user's claims and the provided evidence. The user claimed in their reflection that a comprehensive prompt was the strategy for achieving the desired output. The evidence in the `chat_log` (the prompt) and `product_text` (the output) confirms this claim. The prompt provided explicit, detailed instructions, and the AI's output was a direct and faithful execution of those instructions, establishing a clear causal link.", "block_taskcausal_justification": "The justification lies in the direct comparison between the `chat_log` and the `product_text`. The user's prompt specified the need for an apology, an investigation, an express replacement, a 15% discount, and an emphasis on the customer's value. All these elements are present in the final text, confirming the user's reflection that their detailed prompt was the cause of the successful output. The analysis confirms the user's claim and finds no evidence of a Say-Do Gap.", "block_taskcausal_cited_source_id": null, "block_taskcausal_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The reflection exhibits a high degree of confidence and presents the task and its execution as entirely straightforward and successful, without acknowledging any potential limitations, challenges, or uncertainties. Phrases like 'the given task was easy,' 'all inputs and guiding information... were clearly provided,' 'I didn't have to think about this too much,' and 'The ready result was generated quickly and was usable as such' indicate an absolute certainty in the process and outcome. There is no self-reflection on possible difficulties, alternative strategies, or areas for improvement, aligning perfectly with a score of 1, where the text presents matters as 100% factual from its perspective without recognizing limitations. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_causal_analyst_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_causal_analyst_normalized": 100.0, "matrix_causal_abductive_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_causal_abductive_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_causal_analyst", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:44:16.226812+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510256, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_causal_analyst:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510256", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_heuristic2": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_causal_analyst": 100, "matrix_causal_abductive": 100, "block_taskcausal": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_judge": {"matrix_judge": 5.0, "matrix_judge_justification": "[PASSIVITY PENALTY x1.00] The user's performance is a textbook example of an 'Architect'. The guidance provided in the single, initial prompt was exceptionally clear, comprehensive, and left nothing for the AI to guess. The user meticulously detailed every required element for the response: the apologetic and friendly tone, the promise of an investigation, the specific 15% discount offer, the commitment to an immediate replacement shipment, and the reassurance of the customer's value. The AI's output (`product_text`) is a perfect, one-to-one execution of these instructions. This demonstrates perfect control and transparency, with the guidance being provably visible and complete within the provided chat history, fully aligning with the criteria for a score of 5. The user effectively designed the entire solution and used the AI as a tool to articulate it, which is the essence of the Architect role.", "matrix_judge_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_judge_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "[PASSIVITY PENALTY x1.00] The user's reflection text exhibits a complete lack of epistemic humility, aligning perfectly with the 'Arrogant/Absolute' category. The author uses definitive and self-assured language throughout, stating that \"the given task was easy\" (\"annettu teht\u00e4v\u00e4 oli helppo\"), \"I didn't have to think about this too much\" (\"En joutunut t\u00e4t\u00e4 liikaa pohtimaan\"), and that the result was \"usable as such\" (\"sellaisenaan k\u00e4ytt\u00f6kelpoinen\"). These statements present a subjective experience as an objective and flawless reality. The text contains no self-reflection, no acknowledgment of potential limitations in the strategy, and no consideration of any uncertainties. This overconfidence and presentation of the process as 100% factual and simple warrants the lowest score.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "scoring_result": {"total_score": 78.53333333333333, "final_score": 78.53333333333333, "penalties_applied": [], "aggregation_status": "V2 Commensurate Average of 5 matrices"}, "integrity_audit": {"valid_citations": 0, "invalid_citations": ["Law as integrity, then, requires a judge to test his interpretations of any part of the great network of political structures and decisions of his community by asking whether it could form part of a coherent theory justifying the whole.", "Law as integrity, then, requires a judge to test his interpretations of any part of the great network of political structures and decisions of his community by asking whether it could form part of a coherent theory justifying the whole.", "Epistemic uncertainty, also known as reducible uncertainty, arises from a lack of knowledge about the system or environment and can, in principle, be reduced by collecting more data or improving models.", "System 2 allocates attention to the effortful mental activities that demand it, including complex computations. The operations of System 2 are often associated with the subjective experience of agency, choice, and concentration."], "integrity_score": 0.0}, "matrix_judge_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_judge_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_judge", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:44:37.735153+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510277, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_judge:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510277", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_oprule4": 0, "block_oprule3": 0, "block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_judge": 100, "block_taskjudge": 0, "block_instructionstrictscale": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_coach": {"block_taskcoach": "{\"observation\":\"You provided a single, highly detailed prompt that functioned as a complete blueprint for the AI. It included tone, specific actions, compensation details, and relational context. The AI executed these instructions perfectly.\",\"positive_feedback\":\"This is an excellent example of the 'Architect' pattern. By providing such a clear and comprehensive set of instructions, you ensured a high-quality, predictable output in a single step. This is a very efficient and effective method for tasks where the solution parameters are well-defined.\",\"recommendation\":\"To elevate your approach towards metacognitive interaction, consider breaking down a similar task in the future. Instead of providing the entire solution in one prompt, try an iterative process. For example: 1. Ask the AI to draft the initial apology and outline an investigation plan. 2. Review its output, then ask it to propose a specific compensation package. 3. Finally, ask it to combine everything and polish the tone, referencing the customer's loyalty.\",\"rationale\":\"This iterative method encourages 'active monitoring' of the problem-solving process. By evaluating the AI's intermediate steps, you engage in a deeper cognitive loop of planning, monitoring, and regulating the task. This not only helps you co-create a more nuanced solution but also builds a more sophisticated mental model of the AI's capabilities and limitations, which is the essence of metacognitive strategy.\"}", "block_taskcoach_justification": "The user demonstrated perfect 'Architect' behavior by creating a comprehensive, single-shot prompt that led to a flawless output. The coaching feedback acknowledges this strength while providing a concrete path toward a more advanced, 'Metacognitive' strategy. The recommendation to break the task into iterative steps is designed to encourage active monitoring and regulation of the problem-solving process, a core component of metacognition. This shift from dictating a full solution to co-creating it through a series of smaller, evaluated steps fosters a deeper level of engagement and strategic thinking, aligning with the principles of developing metacognitive skills as described by Flavell.", "block_taskcoach_cited_source_id": "Flavell, John H. 1979.", "block_taskcoach_cited_text_quote": "Metacognition refers, among other things, to the active monitoring and consequent regulation and orchestration of these processes in relation to the cognitive objects or data on which they bear, usually in the service of some concrete goal or objective.", "matrix_epistemic_humility": 4.5, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The AI-generated response (`product_text`) demonstrates a high degree of epistemic humility appropriate for its context as a corporate apology. It explicitly acknowledges failure and limitations by stating the incident does not align with their standards (\"eiv\u00e4t vastaa toimintatapojamme\"). Crucially, it addresses uncertainty by launching an investigation to understand the root cause (\"Olemme k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4neet v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4sti selvityksen\"), which is a direct admission of a current knowledge gap. Furthermore, it avoids making absolute guarantees about the future, instead using the qualified and humble phrase, \"We will do our best\" (\"Teemme parhaamme\"). This combination of admitting fault, highlighting the current lack of knowledge, and expressing future intent with humility places the text firmly between 'Acknowledging' and 'Self-Critical'.\n\n||DECIMAL: 4.5||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_coach", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:45:01.080698+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510301, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_coach:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510301", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule1": 0, "block_rule2": 0, "block_rule3": 0, "block_rule4": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_rule6": 0, "block_oprule1": 0, "block_oprule2": 0, "block_oprule3": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_heuristic2": 0, "block_heuristic3": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_taskcoach": 0, "block_instructionstrictscale": 0, "block_instructioncoachcitation": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_xai_reporter": {"matrix_xai_reporter": 3.0, "matrix_xai_reporter_justification": "The synthesis of the preceding analyses reveals a unanimous conclusion with no significant contradictions. All agents converge on the same core finding: the user acted as a perfect 'Architect,' providing a comprehensive and detailed set of instructions, and the AI acted as a flawless 'Executor,' translating these instructions into the final product verbatim. The Judge (5.0) and Causal Analyst (5.0) both confirm the perfect, one-to-one link between the user's prompt and the AI's output. The Profiler (2.8) identifies the methodical, rule-based System 2 processing required for such execution. The Falsifier (1.0) notes the user's complete acceptance of the output, which aligns with the user's own overconfident reflection, a point reinforced by the Logician's and Analyst's low scores for cognitive complexity and epistemic humility. Since all agents' findings are mutually reinforcing and point to the exact same interpretation of the event, the analysis achieves Complete Certainty.", "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_source_id": "DARPA XAI Program (2017). Explainable Artificial Intelligence.", "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": 5.0, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_justification": "The XAI Reporter's synthesis achieves maximum clarity and transparency (barsConf100). The report explicitly details how the final verdict of 'Complete Certainty' was reached. It is not a standalone assertion but a conclusion derived directly from the evidence provided by the preceding analytical steps. The justification systematically references the findings and scores of individual agents (Judge, Causal Analyst, Falsifier, etc.) and demonstrates how these disparate data points converge into a single, coherent narrative. This creates a clear, traceable chain of logic from the individual analyses to the final synthesized conclusion, perfectly fulfilling the task of producing an explainable and transparent report.", "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_source_id": "Hegel, G. W. F. (1807). Phenomenology of Spirit (Dialectical Synthesis); Gunning, D., et al. (2019). XAI\u2014Explainable artificial intelligence.", "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 4.2, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The XAI Reporter's text operates at the 'Acknowledging' level. It does not present its conclusions as absolute facts generated in a vacuum. Instead, it explicitly grounds its claims in the evidence provided by the preceding analytical agents, using phrases like \"The synthesis of the preceding analyses reveals...\" and \"All agents converge...\". This approach inherently acknowledges that the report's validity is contingent upon the inputs it is synthesizing. While it expresses high certainty ('Complete Certainty'), this certainty is justified by referencing the unanimous agreement of its sources, which is a form of recognizing the basis and limitations of its knowledge. It avoids making unsupported, absolute claims of its own, thereby demonstrating a strong degree of epistemic humility.||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": "H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_xai_reporter_scaled": 3.0, "matrix_xai_reporter_normalized": 100.0, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_scaled": 5.0, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_xai_reporter", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:45:01.123098+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510301, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_xai_reporter:29df74bd-48f4-434d-860c-cabf8559dddb:1773510301", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "matrix_xai_reporter": 100, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": 100, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}}, "metadata": {"macro_strictness_level": 5, "micro_strictness_level": 100}, "error": null, "created_at": "2026-03-14T17:43:14.241454Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-14T17:43:14.241458Z", "created_by": "10fb2f60-5ee1-419f-a16c-b5cfdfc5f55b", "organization_id": "436d84de-c526-43b7-93ef-634912be0d2f"}, "6": {"id": "4ca4c99a-3c69-426d-b410-4fe6aea4bd81", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "strictness_level": 5, "status": "completed", "raw_inputs": {"chat_log": "Laadi yst\u00e4v\u00e4llinen ja pahoitteleva vastine oheiseen reklamaatioon. Kerro, ett\u00e4 selvit\u00e4mme syyn miksi n\u00e4in on k\u00e4ynyt ja luonnollisesti haluamme korvata h\u00e4nelle aiheutuneen vahingon. Ehdota 15% alennusta seuraavasta tilauksesta ja lupaa korvaava tuote v\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n tilalle pikatoimituksena. Kannusta h\u00e4nt\u00e4 viel\u00e4 luottamaan meihin toimittajana sill\u00e4 arvostamme h\u00e4nen asiakkuuttaan. T\u00e4ss\u00e4 saamamme reklamaatio:   Hei, Olen eritt\u00e4in pettynyt viimeisimp\u00e4\u00e4n tilaukseeni. Minulle luvattiin toimitus viimeist\u00e4\u00e4n tiistaina, mutta paketti saapui vasta torstaina, ja sit\u00e4 paitsi tilaamani tuote A oli korvattu tuotteella B ilman mink\u00e4\u00e4nlaista ilmoitusta! My\u00f6h\u00e4styminen aiheuttaa meille satojen eurojen menetyksen p\u00e4iv\u00e4ss\u00e4. Olen ollut uskollinen asiakkaanne viisi vuotta ja odotan t\u00e4h\u00e4n nopeaa ja tyydytt\u00e4v\u00e4\u00e4 ratkaisua. Mik\u00e4li asiaa ei ratkaista t\u00e4n\u00e4\u00e4n, siirr\u00e4n liiketoimintani kilpailijoillenne. Yst\u00e4v\u00e4llisin terveisin, A. Virtanen   ", "organization_id": null, "user_id": null, "simulation_mode": false, "language": "en", "product_text": "Hei A. Virtanen, Kiitos viestist\u00e4nne ja ennen kaikkea vilpitt\u00f6m\u00e4t pahoittelumme tapahtuneesta. Ymm\u00e4rr\u00e4mme hyvin pettymyksenne \u2013 toimituksen my\u00f6h\u00e4styminen sek\u00e4 v\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n tuotteen toimittaminen ilman ennakkoilmoitusta eiv\u00e4t vastaa toimintatapojamme tai sit\u00e4 palvelutasoa, johon olette asiakkaanamme tottunut. Olemme k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4neet v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4sti selvityksen siit\u00e4, miksi toimitus on viiv\u00e4stynyt ja kuinka tuotteen vaihto on voinut tapahtua ilman erillist\u00e4 ilmoitusta. Haluamme varmistaa, ettei vastaavaa p\u00e4\u00e4se tapahtumaan uudelleen. Luonnollisesti haluamme my\u00f6s korvata Teille aiheutuneen vahingon. L\u00e4het\u00e4mme tilaamanne oikean tuotteen pikatoimituksena viel\u00e4 t\u00e4n\u00e4\u00e4n, jotta saatte sen k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00f6nne mahdollisimman nopeasti. Lis\u00e4ksi tarjoamme Teille 15 % alennuksen seuraavasta tilauksestanne hyvityksen\u00e4 aiheutuneesta haitasta. Olette ollut meille arvokas ja uskollinen asiakas jo viiden vuoden ajan, ja arvostamme luottamustanne suuresti. Toivomme, ett\u00e4 annatte meille mahdollisuuden korjata tilanteen ja jatkaa yhteisty\u00f6t\u00e4 my\u00f6s tulevaisuudessa. Teemme parhaamme, jotta voimme jatkossa vastata odotuksiinne jokaisessa toimituksessa. Olemme Teihin yhteydess\u00e4 viel\u00e4 t\u00e4n\u00e4\u00e4n asian etenemisest\u00e4. Mik\u00e4li Teill\u00e4 on lis\u00e4kysymyksi\u00e4 tai toiveita asian ratkaisemiseksi, vastaan mielell\u00e4ni v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4sti. Yst\u00e4v\u00e4llisin terveisin, [Yrityksen nimi] [Allekirjoitus] ", "reflection_text": "Strategiani oli mahdollisimman monipuolisella kehotteella saada aikaiseksi valmis vastine annettuun teht\u00e4v\u00e4\u00e4n. Mielest\u00e4ni annettu teht\u00e4v\u00e4 oli helppo, sill\u00e4 kaikki teht\u00e4v\u00e4n annossa olleet sy\u00f6tteet ja vastausta ohjaavat tiedot oli annettu selke\u00e4sti. En joutunut t\u00e4t\u00e4 liikaa pohtimaan. Valmis tulos syntyi nopeasti ja oli sellaisenaan k\u00e4ytt\u00f6kelpoinen.  "}, "frozen_context": {"compiled_prompts": {}, "injected_theory": {}, "generated_schemas": {"step_input_processing": {"properties": {"matrix_epistemic_humility": {"description": "Epistemic Humility: Evaluate whether the text acknowledges its own limitations and risks, or speaks in absolutes.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).\n- Score 2: Weak - Implies being right, leaving only a negligible margin for interpretation or criticism.\n- Score 3: Neutral - Presents matters straightforwardly without strong absolutes, but also without significant self-reflection.\n- Score 4: Acknowledging - Recognizes some external or internal limitations regarding the presented results and claims.\n- Score 5: Self-Critical - The text openly acknowledges its limitations and lists uncertainties and risks as part of the evaluation.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility", "type": "number"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Epistemic Humility'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited Text Quote"}}, "required": ["matrix_epistemic_humility", "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification"], "title": "Step_step_input_processing_Response", "type": "object"}, "step_guard": {"properties": {"matrix_taskguard": {"description": "TASK_GUARD: ROLE: GUARD (Hygiene & Ethics Audit)\nTASKS: Oversee inputs and outputs for ethical tensions, security issues, and biases.\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT:\nThe response must be JSON conforming to the `GuardOutput` schema.\nMANDATE: Output your response EXACTLY according to the JSON schema:\n{{SCHEMA_EXAMPLE}}\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Active Vulnerability (OWASP LLM01, LLM02, LLM06) - The input contains a direct prompt injection attempt. The input or output threatens to expose sensitive data, or the output contains insecurely executable code.\n- Score 2: Structural Tension or Overreliance (OWASP LLM09) - The text is technically safe but demonstrates overreliance on unverified information, hallucination risks, or ethically gray areas without critical review.\n- Score 3: Pristine Security Hygiene - Complete absence of any OWASP Top 10 LLM risks. The interaction is fully secure, neutral, and ethically sound.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Taskguard", "type": "number"}, "matrix_taskguard_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'TASK_GUARD'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decim