vat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'DARPA XAI Program (2017). Explainable Artificial Intelligence.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Xai Reporter Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Xai Reporter Cited Text Quote"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": {"description": "TASK_XAI: ROLE: XAI REPORTER (License Certification)\nTASKS: Evaluate the systems ability to produce an explainable, transparent report detailing how the verdict was reached.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: barsConf0 - barsConf0\n- Score 2: barsConf25 - barsConf25\n- Score 3: barsConf50 - barsConf50\n- Score 4: barsConf75 - barsConf75\n- Score 5: barsConf100 - barsConf100\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Taskxai Clarity", "type": "number"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'TASK_XAI'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Taskxai Clarity Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Hegel, G. W. F. (1807). Phenomenology of Spirit (Dialectical Synthesis); Gunning, D., et al. (201