s.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).\n- Score 2: Weak - Implies being right, leaving only a negligible margin for interpretation or criticism.\n- Score 3: Neutral - Presents matters straightforwardly without strong absolutes, but also without significant self-reflection.\n- Score 4: Acknowledging - Recognizes some external or internal limitations regarding the presented results and claims.\n- Score 5: Self-Critical - The text openly acknowledges its limitations and lists uncertainties and risks as part of the evaluation.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility", "type": "number"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Epistemic Humility'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited Text Quote"}}, "required": ["matrix_kahneman", "matrix_kahneman_justification", "matrix_epistemic_humility", "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification"], "title": "Step_step_profiler_Response", "type": "object"}, "step_archivist": {"properties": {"matrix_archivist": {"description": "Archivist: Olet Arkistonhoitaja (Archivist). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on peilata teko\u00e4lyn toimintaa organisaation aikaisempiin (Precedent) linjauksiin ja ohjeisiin. Varmista s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jenmukaisuus ja Stare Decisis -periaatteen toteutuminen.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Critically Misaligned - Action is completely random brute force trial and error.\n- Score 2: Misaligned - Individual good practices visible but overall unguided.\n- Score 3: Neutral - Follows a basic process but does not utilize best practices.\n- Score 4: Aligned - Actively uses structured steering models (e.g. clear roles and constraints).\n- Score 5: Strongly Aligned - Action represents State of the Art level in AI steering.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Archivist", "type": "number"}, "matrix_archivist_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Archivist'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Archivist Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_archivist_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Dworkin, R. (1986). Law's Empire. (Stare Decisis, Precedent and Organizational Integrity).", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Dworkin, R. (1986). Law's Empire. (Stare Decisis, Precedent and Organizational Integrity).'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Archivist Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_archivist_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Archivist Cited Text Quote"}, "block_taskarchivist": {"description": "TASK_ARCHIVIST: ROLE: ARCHIVIST (Best Practices & Precedent Audit)\nYour task is to ensure that the user's action and decision-making seen in the material align with previous precedents (Relevant Cases) and organizational standards.\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT:\nThe response must be JSON conforming to the `ArchivistOutput` schema.\nMANDATE: Output your response EXACTLY according to the JSON schema.\nWARNING: Return 'relevant_cases' as a list and provide the 'compliance_analysis' score strictly utilizing the defined BARS matrix.\n{{SCHEMA_EXAMPLE}}", "title": "Block Taskarchivist", "type": "string"}, "block_taskarchivist_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'TASK_ARCHIVIST'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION.", "title": "Block Taskarchivist Justification", "type": "string"}, "block_taskarchivist_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Dworkin, Ronald 1986.", "type": "string"}, {