ial initiative, but no harm was done.\n- Score 4: Driver (Good) - User utilized RFI, monitored instruction compliance, and forced the AI to ask clarifications.\n- Score 5: Architect (Excellent) - Perfect control and transparency. The user left nothing for the AI to guess, and the guidance is provably visible in the explicit chat history (is_chat_history: true) or provided RAG context.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Judge", "type": "number"}, "matrix_judge_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Judge'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Judge Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_judge_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Floridi, L. (2014). The Fourth Revolution: How the Infosphere is Reshaping Human Reality. (Human-in-the-loop vs. Human-on-the-loop agency).", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Floridi, L. (2014). The Fourth Revolution: How the Infosphere is Reshaping Human Reality. (Human-in-the-loop vs. Human-on-the-loop agency).'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Judge Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_judge_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00