e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Block Taskcoach Cited Text Quote"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility": {"description": "Epistemic Humility: Evaluate whether the text acknowledges its own limitations and risks, or speaks in absolutes.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).\n- Score 2: Weak - Implies being right, leaving only a negligible margin for interpretation or criticism.\n- Score 3: Neutral - Presents matters straightforwardly without strong absolutes, but also without significant self-reflection.\n- Score 4: Acknowledging - Recognizes some external or internal limitations regarding the presented results and claims.\n- Score 5: Self-Critical - The text openly acknowledges its limitations and lists uncertainties and risks as part of the evaluation.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility", "type": "number"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Epistemic Humility'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited Text Quote"}}, "required": ["block_taskcoach", "block_taskcoach_justification", "matrix_epistemic_humility", "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification"], "title": "Step_step_coach_Response", "type": "object"}, "step_xai_reporter": {"properties": {"matrix_xai_reporter": {"description": "XAI Reporter: Olet selitett\u00e4v\u00e4n teko\u00e4lyn raportoija (XAI Reporter). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on koota kaikkien aiempien analyysivaiheiden l\u00f6yd\u00f6kset yhdeksi selke\u00e4ksi, l\u00e4pin\u00e4kyv\u00e4ksi ja tiiviiksi synteesiksi, joka nostaa esiin t\u00e4rkeimm\u00e4t huomiot ja vinoumat.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Extremely Uncertain (0%) - Agent analyses are completely contradictory.\n- Score 2: Moderately Certain (50%) - Most agents agree, but significant interpretative ambiguities remain.\n- Score 3: Complete Certainty (100%) - All agents unanimously support exactly the same outcome.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Xai Reporter", "type": "number"}, "matrix_xai_reporter_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'XAI Reporter'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Xai Reporter Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "DARPA XAI Program (2017). Explainable Artificial Intelligence.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'DARPA XAI Program (2017). Explainable Artificial Intelligence.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Xai Reporter Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Xai Reporter Cited Text Quote"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": {"description": "TASK_XAI: ROLE: XAI REPORTER (License Certification)\nTASKS: Evaluate the systems ability to produce an explainable, transparent report detailing how the verdict was reached.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: barsConf0 - barsConf0\n- Score 2: barsConf25 - barsConf25\n- Score 3: barsConf50 - barsConf50\n- Score 4: barsConf75 - barsConf75\n- Score 5: barsConf100 - barsConf100\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Taskxai Clarity", "type": "number"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'TASK_XAI'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Taskxai Clarity Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Hegel, G. W. F. (1807). Phenomenology of Spirit (Dialectical Synthesis); Gunning, D., et al. (2019). XAI\u2014Explainable artificial intelligence.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Hegel, G. W. F. (1807). Phenomenology of Spirit (Dialectical Synthesis); Gunning, D., et al. (2019). XAI\u2014Explainable artificial intelligence.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Taskxai Clarity Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Taskxai Clarity Cited Text Quote"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility": {"description": "Epistemic Humility: Evaluate whether the text acknowledges its own limitations and risks, or speaks in absolutes.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).\n- Score 2: Weak - Implies being right, leaving only a negligible margin for interpretation or criticism.\n- Score 3: Neutral - Pre