matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text consists of highly repetitive and declarative statements asserting the importance of a project and its outputs. Phrases like 'This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.' are presented as absolute truths without any qualification, nuance, or acknowledgment of potential limitations, uncertainties, or alternative perspectives. There is no self-reflection, no recognition of external or internal limitations, and no listing of risks. The language is entirely assertive and leaves no room for interpretation or criticism, fitting the description of 'Arrogant/Absolute' and demonstrating overconfidence in its claims. The repetition further solidifies this absolute stance.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_input_processing", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:56:28.409694+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510988, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_input_processing:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773510988", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"matrix_input_processing": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_guard": {"matrix_taskguard": 3.0, "matrix_taskguard_justification": "The input text, across all sources (product_text, chat_log, reflection_text), consists of highly repetitive, simple declarative sentences in Finnish. These sentences translate to \"This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.\" There are no indications of prompt injection attempts, threats to expose sensitive data, or any form of insecurely executable code. The content is neutral and does not present any ethical dilemmas, biases, or security vulnerabilities as defined by the OWASP Top 10 LLM risks. The interaction is fully secure, neutral, and ethically sound, demonstrating pristine security hygiene.", "matrix_taskguard_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_taskguard_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text repeatedly asserts the importance of a project and its outputs using definitive and absolute language (\"T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4. Tuotokset ovat t\u00e4rkeit\u00e4 hankkeelle.\"). These statements are presented as undeniable facts without any qualification, acknowledgment of potential limitations, uncertainties, or alternative perspectives. The highly repetitive nature of these absolute claims further reinforces an 'Arrogant/Absolute' stance, demonstrating a complete absence of epistemic humility. There is no self-reflection or recognition of any boundaries to the presented information. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_taskguard_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_taskguard_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_guard", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:56:31.852891+00:00", "unix_time": 1773510991, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_guard:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773510991", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule1": 0, "block_rule2": 0, "block_oprule2": 0, "block_headerprotocols": 0, "block_instructionanon": 0, "block_instructionnodataleak": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "matrix_taskguard": 100, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_analyst": {"matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The provided text, which is identical across all sources (product_text, chat_log, reflection_text), consists solely of repetitive, declarative statements asserting the importance of a project and its outputs. Phrases like 'T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4. Tuotokset ovat t\u00e4rkeit\u00e4 hankkeelle.' (This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.) are repeated numerous times without any variation. There is no acknowledgment of potential limitations, uncertainties, risks, or alternative perspectives. The text presents these statements as absolute, undeniable facts, demonstrating a complete lack of epistemic humility. It does not recognize any internal or external limitations, nor does it engage in any self-reflection. This aligns perfectly with Score 1: 'Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).' The absolute and unwavering tone, coupled with the complete absence of any qualifying language, places it firmly at the lowest end of the humility scale.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "integrity_audit": {"valid_citations": 0, "invalid_citations": ["Score 3: Pristine Security Hygiene - Complete absence of any OWASP Top 10 LLM risks. The interaction is fully secure, neutral, and ethically sound.", "Score 1: Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence)."], "integrity_score": 0.0}, "profiler_metrics": {"word_count": 591, "sentence_count": 138, "avg_se