justification": "The text exclusively contains absolute statements such as \"This is an important project\" and \"The project is very important.\" These claims are presented as undeniable facts without any supporting evidence, context, or qualification. The user demonstrates no awareness of potential limitations, alternative perspectives, or any form of uncertainty. This dogmatic and overconfident presentation style directly corresponds to the \"Arrogant/Absolute\" category, which is defined by presenting matters as 100% factual without recognizing any limitations. The repetitive nature of the input reinforces this absolute stance. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_kahneman_scaled": 6.0, "matrix_kahneman_normalized": 33.33333333333333, "profiler_metrics": {"word_count": 591, "sentence_count": 138, "avg_sentence_length": 4.28, "lexical_diversity": 0.06, "capitalization_ratio": 0.07, "control_ratio": 1.0, "say_do_gap": 0.0, "automation_bias": 0.0, "illusion_of_competence": 0.0, "imperative_command_count": 0}, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_profiler", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:56:43.572636+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511003, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_profiler:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511003", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_heuristic2": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_kahneman": 100, "block_taskprofiler": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_logician": {"matrix_toulmin": 1.0, "matrix_toulmin_justification": "The argument presented is fundamentally non-existent according to Toulmin's model. The text makes a claim, \"This is an important project\" (\"T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke\"), but provides absolutely no data or grounds to support it. The subsequent sentences, \"The project is very important\" and \"The outputs are important for the project,\" are merely restatements or further unsupported claims, not evidence. An argument requires, at a minimum, a claim and data. Since the text is completely devoid of any supporting data, it fails at the most basic level of argumentation. This aligns perfectly with the lowest score, as the claim is entirely without grounds.", "matrix_toulmin_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_toulmin_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_bloom": 1.0, "matrix_bloom_justification": "The cognitive level demonstrated in the text is squarely at the 'Remembering' stage of Bloom's Taxonomy. The content consists of the verbatim repetition of a few simple phrases. There is no evidence of understanding, as the text does not paraphrase, explain, or interpret the information. It is a pure act of recall and repetition, akin to rote memorization. The user is simply stating learned information without implying any comprehension of why the project is important or what the implications are. This performance is the definition of the first and most basic level of the taxonomy.", "matrix_bloom_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_bloom_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text exhibits a complete lack of epistemic humility. It consists entirely of absolute, declarative statements such as \"This is an important project\" and \"The project is very important.\" These assertions are presented as incontrovertible facts without any nuance, qualification, or acknowledgment of alternative viewpoints. The text does not recognize any limitations, risks, or uncertainties. This dogmatic and repetitive presentation of a subjective opinion as an absolute truth is a clear example of the 'Arrogant/Absolute' category, reflecting maximum overconfidence.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_toulmin_scaled": 5.2, "matrix_toulmin_normalized": 20.0, "matrix_bloom_scaled": 5.0, "matrix_bloom_normalized": 16.666666666666664, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_logician", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:56:43.341724+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511003, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_logician:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511003", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule3": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructioncitationobligation": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_toulmin": 100, "matrix_bloom": 100, "block_tasklogician": 0, "block_instructionstrictscale": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_causal_analyst": {"matrix_causal_analyst": 5.0, "matrix_causal_analyst_justification": "The cause-and-effect relationship is direct and indisputable. The `product_text` is an exact, verbatim copy of the user's input from the `chat_log`. The user provided the text, and that text became the output without any modification, interpretation, or generation by an AI. This represents the most direct causal link possible, where the input is the output. The quality and content of the final product are 100% determined by the explicit guidance provided by the user. This aligns perfectly with a 'Genuine' score, as the effect is a direct and undeniable result of the cause.", "matrix_causal_analyst_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_causal_analyst_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_causal_abductive": 3.0, "matrix_causal_abductive_justification": "The user's guidance was a genuine, pre-active strategic choice. The `chat_log` shows the user providing the exact text that constitutes the final `product_text`. This is not a case of post-hoc rationalization where a user explains a successful outcome after the fact. Instead, the user explicitly defined the desired outcome in its entirety from the very beginning. The user's 'vision' was to have this specific repetitive text as the output, and their prompt was the direct mechanism to achieve it. This is a clear instance of a genuine, pre-meditated action.", "matrix_causal_abductive_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_causal_abductive_cited_text_quote": null, "block_taskcausal": "TASK_CAUSAL: ROLE: CAUSAL ANALYST (Impact Verification)\nYour task is to evaluate the cause-and-effect relationship between claims made in the context and the verifiable action (evidence).\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT:\nThe response must be JSON conforming to the `CausalOutput` schema. Ensure the `counterfactual_test` is filled comprehensively, including your numeric scores from the provided matrix scales and the Counterfactual Simulation result.\nMANDATE: Output your response EXACTLY according to the JSON schema (CausalOutput).\nWARNING: DO NOT FLATTEN THE STRUCTURE. You must return a 'causal_analysis' object INSIDE which are the analysis fields. Ensure the response contains a 'reasoning_trace' string and the 'causal_analysis' object:\n{{SCHEMA_EXAMPLE}}\n\nIMPORTANT: You will be provided with a 'search_result' object containing empirical facts retrieved by Vertex AI. Use THESE FACTS primarily to verify the validity of cause-and-effect relationships.\n\nCONTEXT: Dynamic input recognition.\nPROHIBITION: Do NOT assume a file 'REFLECTION_TEXT' exists. Read the 'ai_description' field to identify files.\nMANDATE: Look for inputs flagged with 'is_chat_history: true'. This is the only real communication log. If a reflection exists in other files, compare it to the chat history (Look for Say-Do Gaps). Do not penalize if the reflection is entirely missing.", "block_taskcausal_justification": "The causal analysis was performed by directly comparing the user's input, as recorded in the `chat_log` (the cause), with the final `product_text` (the effect). The evidence is the verbatim identity between the two sources. The user's prompt, consisting of repetitive Finnish sentences, is the sole and direct cause of the output. No other variables or AI processes influenced the result. A counterfactual test is simple: had the user provided different text, the output text would have been different. The impact is therefore verified as 100% attributable to the user's action.", "block_taskcausal_cited_source_id": null, "block_taskcausal_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text, which is identical across all provided sources (`product_text`, `chat_log`, `reflection_text`), consists exclusively of repetitive, absolute statements: 'T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4. Tuotokset ovat t\u00e4rkeit\u00e4 hankkeelle.' (This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.). These declarations are presented as incontrovertible facts without any supporting evidence, nuance, or acknowledgment of potential limitations or alternative viewpoints. The complete absence of any self-reflection or qualifying language places the text firmly in the 'Arrogant/Absolute' category, as it demonstrates total overconfidence in its assertions.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_causal_analyst_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_causal_analyst_normalized": 100.0, "matrix_causal_abductive_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_causal_abductive_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_causal_analyst", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:57:01.462626+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511021, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_causal_analyst:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511021", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_heuristic2": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_causal_analyst": 100, "matrix_causal_abductive": 100, "block_taskcausal": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_performativity_detector": {"matrix_goodhart": 1.0, "matrix_goodhart_justification": "The provided text across all sources is a simple, repetitive mantra asserting the importance of a project ('T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke...'). It does not engage in any form of analysis, questioning, or critical thinking. The Goodhart matrix evaluates the user's critical engagement with metrics and goals, from blind faith to active challenging. The provided text represents the lowest possible level on this scale. It is not reacting to an AI, but the content itself embodies a mindset of 'blind faith' or uncritical assertion, completely devoid of any questioning of the stated 'importance' (the implicit goal/metric). It does not correct errors, question logic, or demand evidence because it operates at a level below that, simply stating a belief as fact. This aligns with the principle of Score 1.", "matrix_goodhart_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_goodhart_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text provided across all sources is identical, consisting of endlessly repeated declarative statements such as 'T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4.' (This is an important project. The project is very important.). These statements are presented as absolute, objective facts without any qualification, nuance, or acknowledgment of limitations. The text does not recognize any potential uncertainties, risks, or alternative perspectives regarding the project's importance. This aligns perfectly with the description for Score 1: 'Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).' The unwavering and repetitive nature of the assertions demonstrates a complete lack of epistemic humility.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_goodhart_scaled": 5.2, "matrix_goodhart_normalized": 20.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_performativity_detector", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:57:03.198592+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511023, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_performativity_detector:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511023", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 0, "block_instructionnohallucination": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_goodhart": 100, "block_taskperformativity": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_judge": {"matrix_judge": 1.0, "matrix_judge_justification": "[PASSIVITY PENALTY x1.00] The evaluation of the user's role is based on the provided `chat_log`. This log shows a complete absence of interaction or guidance. The user did not instruct the AI, monitor its output, or engage in any form of dialogue. Instead, the user simply pasted a block of repetitive, low-quality text which became the final product. According to the evaluation matrix, the lowest score, 'Passenger (Rejected),' is assigned for having 'No quality assurance' and 'guidance was random.' In this case, there was no guidance at all, which is a performance even below random guidance. The user took on the role of content creator, not a guide, and the created content was of minimal value. Therefore, the performance is a clear failure in guiding an AI process.", "matrix_judge_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_judge_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "[PASSIVITY PENALTY x1.00] The provided text, consistent across all sources, is composed entirely of absolute and repetitive declarations such as 'This is an important project' and 'The project is very important.' These statements are presented as incontrovertible facts without any supporting evidence, context, or acknowledgment of limitations. There is a total lack of nuance, recognition of uncertainty, or consideration of alternative perspectives. This performance aligns perfectly with the 'Arrogant/Absolute' category, as the text presents subjective matters as 100% factual without any self-reflection. The consensus from all prior evaluation steps confirms this assessment. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "scoring_result": {"total_score": 51.33333333333333, "final_score": 51.33333333333333, "penalties_applied": [], "aggregation_status": "V2 Commensurate Average of 5 matrices"}, "integrity_audit": {"valid_citations": 0, "invalid_citations": ["System 1 operates automatically and quickly, with little or no effort and no sense of voluntary control."], "integrity_score": 0.0}, "matrix_judge_scaled": 5.2, "matrix_judge_normalized": 20.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_judge", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:57:27.438001+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511047, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_judge:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511047", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_oprule4": 0, "block_oprule3": 0, "block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_instruction_strictness": 0, "matrix_judge": 100, "block_taskjudge": 0, "block_instructionstrictscale": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_coach": {"block_taskcoach": "{\n  \"headline\": \"Fundamental Rework Required: Move from Repetition to Reasoned Argumentation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Your submission consists solely of repetitive, unsupported assertions. This approach fails to demonstrate any analytical depth, critical thinking, or guidance. The goal is to build a reasoned argument, not simply repeat a claim. All evaluation metrics (Toulmin, Bloom, Kahneman) scored at the lowest possible level, indicating a need to address the foundational principles of argumentation and analysis.\",\n  \"remediation_steps\": [\n    {\n      \"step\": 1,\n      \"title\": \"Provide Grounds for Your Claim (Toulmin's Model)\",\n      \"description\": \"An argument requires a claim and data (grounds). Your claim is 'the project is important.' You must now provide the 'because' part. For example: 'This project is important BECAUSE it is projected to reduce operational costs by 30%.' Without grounds, it's just an opinion.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 2,\n      \"title\": \"Engage System 2 Thinking (Kahneman)\",\n      \"description\": \"Your response was purely intuitive (System 1). To improve, engage in deliberate, analytical thought (System 2). Ask yourself 'Why is it important?' and 'How can I prove it?'. This moves you from a gut feeling to a structured analysis.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 3,\n      \"title\": \"Ascend Bloom's Taxonomy\",\n      \"description\": \"You are currently at the 'Remembering' level by repeating a phrase. To improve, aim for 'Understanding' by explaining the project's importance in your own words, or 'Analyzing' by breaking down its importance into distinct components (e.g., financial, strategic, operational).\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "block_taskcoach_justification": "The coaching feedback is designed to address the fundamental failure of the user's submission, which scored the lowest possible rating (1.0) across every cognitive and analytical metric from the preceding evaluation steps (Judge, Logician, Profiler, Falsifier). The user's input was merely repetitive, unsupported claims. The remediation directly targets this by providing a clear, technical path to elevate the performance from simple repetition (Bloom's 'Remembering', Kahneman's System 1) to structured, evidence-based argumentation (Toulmin's 'Claim + Data') and higher-order thinking.", "block_taskcoach_cited_source_id": null, "block_taskcoach_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The provided text, which is identical across all sources, consists entirely of absolute and repetitive declarations such as 'This is an important project' and 'The project is very important.' These statements are presented as incontrovertible facts without any supporting evidence, context, or acknowledgment of limitations. There is a total lack of nuance, recognition of uncertainty, or consideration of alternative perspectives. This performance aligns perfectly with the 'Arrogant/Absolute' category, as the text presents subjective matters as 100% factual without any self-reflection. The consensus from all prior evaluation steps confirms this assessment.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_coach", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:57:47.621404+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511067, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_coach:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511067", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_mandate5": 0, "block_headerrules": 0, "block_rule1": 0, "block_rule2": 0, "block_rule3": 0, "block_rule4": 0, "block_rule5": 0, "block_rule6": 0, "block_oprule1": 0, "block_oprule2": 0, "block_oprule3": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_heuristic1": 0, "block_heuristic2": 0, "block_heuristic3": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "block_taskcoach": 0, "block_instructionstrictscale": 0, "block_instructioncoachcitation": 0, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_xai_reporter": {"matrix_xai_reporter": 3.0, "matrix_xai_reporter_justification": "The synthesis of findings from all prior analytical steps reveals a complete and unambiguous consensus. Every agent, from the Judge to the Causal Analyst, reached an identical conclusion about the nature of the user's input and the resulting output. There are no contradictory analyses or interpretative ambiguities whatsoever.\n\nKey unanimous findings include:\n1.  **Cognitive Level:** The input was assessed at the lowest possible cognitive levels: pure 'Remembering' (Bloom's Taxonomy), uncritical System 1 thinking (Kahneman), and a complete failure of argumentation with zero supporting grounds (Toulmin).\n2.  **User Role & Engagement:** The user was identified as a passive 'Passenger' who demonstrated no guidance, critical engagement, or falsification effort. The user simply provided the final text verbatim.\n3.  **Epistemic Humility:** Every single agent independently and unanimously assigned the lowest possible score (1.0) for Epistemic Humility, categorizing the text as 'Arrogant/Absolute' due to its repetitive, unqualified assertions.\n4.  **Causality:** The Causal Analyst confirmed with maximum certainty that the output is a direct and unaltered copy of the user's input.\n\nGiven that all agents unanimously support exactly the same outcome across all relevant metrics, the level of certainty is absolute. This corresponds directly to Score 3: Complete Certainty.", "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_xai_reporter_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": 5.0, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_justification": "This XAI report achieves the highest level of clarity and transparency by design. The verdict is explained through a clear, structured synthesis of the preceding analyses.\n\n1.  **Transparency:** The justification explicitly references the findings from each prior agent (`Judge`, `Profiler`, `Logician`, `Falsifier`, `Causal Analyst`), making the chain of reasoning transparent. It shows *how* the final conclusion was reached by aggregating consistent data points.\n2.  **Clarity:** The report distills the complex analyses into a simple, core finding: all agents unanimously agreed that the user provided low-effort, repetitive text, leading to a low-quality output. This answers the 'why' question central to explainability.\n3.  **Evidence-Based:** The conclusion is not an opinion but is directly tied to the unanimous scores (e.g., Epistemic Humility 1.0, Bloom 1.0, Toulmin 1.0) reported in the previous steps.\n\nBy systematically presenting the consensus evidence, the report provides a fully explainable and transparent account of how the verdict was reached, fulfilling the core mission of the XAI Reporter role.", "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The evaluation of the source text's epistemic humility is based on the unanimous consensus of all preceding analytical agents and a direct reading of the text itself. The text, which is identical across all inputs (`product_text`, `chat_log`, `reflection_text`), consists exclusively of the repetitive and absolute statements: \"This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.\"\n\nThis performance aligns perfectly with the lowest score for the following reasons:\n-   **Absolute Claims:** The text presents subjective judgments about the project's importance as 100% factual and incontrovertible truths.\n-   **No Acknowledgment of Limitations:** There is a complete absence of any language that recognizes uncertainty, risk, alternative perspectives, or limitations of the claims.\n-   **Unanimous Prior Verdict:** Every single preceding agent (`Judge`, `Analyst`, `Profiler`, `Logician`, `Falsifier`, `Causal Analyst`) independently scored the text as 1.0 on this matrix.\n\nThis constitutes a textbook example of the 'Arrogant/Absolute' category, demonstrating total overconfidence and a complete lack of self-reflection.\n\n||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_xai_reporter_scaled": 3.0, "matrix_xai_reporter_normalized": 100.0, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_scaled": 5.0, "matrix_taskxai_clarity_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_xai_reporter", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:57:47.696494+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511067, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_xai_reporter:8f43d110-29d8-4813-a556-b42cda7536d3:1773511067", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 0, "block_headermandates": 0, "block_mandate2": 0, "block_mandate3": 0, "block_principle1": 0, "block_requirement1": 0, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 0, "block_headerinstructions": 0, "matrix_xai_reporter": 100, "matrix_taskxai_clarity": 100, "block_rule_falsification_first": 0, "block_role_saboteur": 0, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 0, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 0, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}}, "metadata": {"macro_strictness_level": 5, "micro_strictness_level": 100}, "error": null, "created_at": "2026-03-14T17:56:16.113452Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-14T17:56:16.113457Z", "created_by": "10fb2f60-5ee1-419f-a16c-b5cfdfc5f55b", "organization_id": "436d84de-c526-43b7-93ef-634912be0d2f"}, "12": {"id": "73656259-6458-4f6d-825a-7aaf3ac28766", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "strictness_level": 5, "status": "completed", "raw_inputs": {"chat_log": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4. Tuotokset ovat t\u00e4rkeit\u00e4 hankkeelle. T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e