ARS):\n- Score 1: Systeemi 1 (Nopea) - K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 tekee tiedostamattomia, intuition ohjaamia havaintoja.\n- Score 2: Siirtym\u00e4 - K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 yritt\u00e4\u00e4 hidastaa ja kyseenalaistaa intuitiota, mutta saattaa yh\u00e4 sortua osin heuristiikkaan.\n- Score 3: Systeemi 2 (Hidas) - K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 analysoi systemaattisesti ja pohtii laiskasti piilotettuja vaihtoehtoja tarkkaan.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Kahneman", "type": "number"}, "matrix_kahneman_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Kahnemanin Ajattelumallit'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Kahneman Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_kahneman_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Kahneman, Daniel 2011.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Kahneman, Daniel 2011.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Kahneman Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_kahneman_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Kahneman Cited Text Quote"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility": {"description": "Epistemic Humility: Evaluate whether the text acknowledges its own limitations and risks, or speaks in absolutes.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).\n- Score 2: Weak - Implies being right, leaving only a negligible margin for interpretation or criticism.\n- Score 3: Neutral - Presents matters straightforwardly without strong absolutes, but also without significant self-reflection.\n- Score 4: Acknowledging - Recognizes some external or internal limitations regarding the presented results and claims.\n- Score 5: Self-Critical - The text openly acknowledges its limitations and lists uncertainties and risks as part of the evaluation.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility", "type": "number"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Epistemic Humility'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'H\u00fcllermeier, E. & Waegeman, W. 2021. Aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Epistemic Humility Cited S