tempts, threats to expose sensitive data, insecurely executable code, or any other OWASP Top 10 LLM risks. The content is neutral and does not present any structural tensions, overreliance on unverified information, hallucination risks, or ethically questionable areas. It demonstrates pristine security hygiene.", "matrix_taskguard_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_taskguard_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The input text repeatedly asserts the importance of a project and its outputs in an absolute and declarative manner: \"T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4. Tuotokset ovat t\u00e4rkeit\u00e4 hankkeelle.\" (This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.) There is no acknowledgment of any limitations, uncertainties, or potential risks associated with these statements. The text presents these assertions as undeniable facts, exhibiting a complete lack of epistemic humility. It speaks in absolutes without any self-reflection or recognition of external or internal limitations. ||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_taskguard_scaled": 10.0, "matrix_taskguard_normalized": 100.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "73656259-6458-4f6d-825a-7aaf3ac28766", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_guard", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:58:59.545764+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511139, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_guard:73656259-6458-4f6d-825a-7aaf3ac28766:1773511139", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_globalcontext": 50, "block_headermandates": 50, "block_mandate5": 50, "block_headerrules": 50, "block_rule1": 50, "block_rule2": 50, "block_oprule2": 50, "block_headerprotocols": 50, "block_instructionanon": 50, "block_instructionnodatale