roject. The project is very important.\"). These are presented as absolute, undeniable facts. The text completely lacks any form of self-reflection, nuance, or acknowledgment of limitations, uncertainties, or alternative perspectives. It is a prime example of presenting information as a 100% fact without recognizing any limitations, which perfectly matches the description for 'Arrogant/Absolute'. The extreme repetition only serves to reinforce this uncritical and absolute stance.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_falsifier_scaled": 5.5, "matrix_falsifier_normalized": 25.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "73656259-6458-4f6d-825a-7aaf3ac28766", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_falsifier", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T17:59:10.149392+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511150, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_falsifier:73656259-6458-4f6d-825a-7aaf3ac28766:1773511150", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_rule4": 50, "block_protocol1": 50, "block_globalcontext": 50, "block_headermandates": 50, "block_mandate5": 50, "block_headerrules": 50, "block_rule5": 50, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 50, "block_instructionnohallucination": 50, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 50, "block_headerinstructions": 50, "block_instruction_strictness": 50, "matrix_falsifier": 100, "block_taskfalsifier": 50, "block_rule_falsification_first": 50, "block_role_saboteur": 50, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 50, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 50, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_logician": {"matrix_toulmin": 1.0, "matrix_toulmin_justification": "The text presents a claim, \"This is an important project,\" but offers no data, evidence, or grounds to support it. The entire submission consists of repeating this core assertion and slight variations of it. According to Toulmin's model, an argument requires, at a minimum, a claim and some data. This text lacks the data component entirely, as well as any warrant, backing, or rebuttal. It is a bare, unsubstantiated claim. Therefore, it aligns perfectly with the lowest score on the matrix: \"Weak - The claim is completely without grounds.\"", "matrix_toulmin_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_toulmin_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_bloom": 1.0, "matrix_bloom_justification": "The cognitive level demonstrated in the text is exclusively at the lowest tier of Bloom's Taxonomy: Remembering. The user is simply repeating a set of phrases verbatim. There is no evidence of understanding, as the information is not paraphrased, explained, or interpreted. The user is not applying the information, analyzing its components, evaluating its worth, or creating anything new. The performance is a textbook example of rote recall, matching the description for a score of 1: \"The user just repeats learned information without implying understanding.\"", "matrix_bloom_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_bloom_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text is composed of absolute, declarative statements like \"This is an important project\" and \"The project is very important.\" These are presented as incontrovertible facts without any acknowledgment of limitations, alternative viewpoints, or uncertainty. The repetitive nature of the text reinforces this dogmatic and absolute stance, leaving no room for interpretation or criticism. This performance is a clear example of the 'Arrogant/Absolute' level, where matters are presented as 100% facts without recognizing any limitations.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_toulmin_scaled": 5.2, "matrix_toulmin_normalized": 20.0, "matrix_bloom_scaled": 5.0, "matrix_bloom_normalized": 16.666666666666664, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "73656259-6458-4f6d-8