eeton tuomio.\n\nEVALUATION MATRIX (BARS):\n- Score 1: Passenger (Rejected) - No quality assurance: factual errors passed, RFI not used, guidance was random.\n- Score 2: Passenger (Weak) - User attempted to guide but let the AI guess too much on its own.\n- Score 3: Navigator (Satisfactory) - Average guidance. AI took partial initiative, but no harm was done.\n- Score 4: Driver (Good) - User utilized RFI, monitored instruction compliance, and forced the AI to ask clarifications.\n- Score 5: Architect (Excellent) - Perfect control and transparency. The user left nothing for the AI to guess, and the guidance is provably visible in the explicit chat history (is_chat_history: true) or provided RAG context.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Arvioi ydinkysymyst\u00e4 yll\u00e4 olevalla matriisilla. Anna lopullinen numeerinen arvio aina yhden desimaalin tarkkuudella (esim. 4.2), jotta arviointi heijastaa suorituksen tarkkaa vivahtekkuutta. Palauta T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN oikeanlainen numeerinen arvo.", "title": "Matrix Judge", "type": "number"}, "matrix_judge_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Judge'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION. CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Write your analysis first. At the VERY END of this text, you MUST provide the final nuanced decimal score in this exact format: ||DECIMAL: 4.2||", "title": "Matrix Judge Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_judge_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Floridi, L. (2014). The Fourth Revolution: How the Infosphere is Reshaping Human Reality. (Human-in-the-loop vs. Human-on-the-loop agency).", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Floridi, L. (2014). The Fourth Revolution: How the Infosphere is Reshaping Human Reality. (Human-in-the-loop vs. Human-on-the-loop agency).'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Judge Cited 