ity": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text under evaluation, found in `product_text`, consists of a highly repetitive set of absolute statements: \"T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke. Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4. Tuotokset ovat t\u00e4rkeit\u00e4 hankkeelle.\" (This is an important project. The project is very important. The outputs are important for the project.). These claims are presented as incontrovertible facts, with no room for interpretation, doubt, or alternative viewpoints. The text does not acknowledge any limitations, risks, or uncertainties associated with the project or its outputs. This style of communication perfectly matches the description for Score 1: 'Arrogant/Absolute - The text presents matters based on 100% facts without recognizing limitations (Overconfidence).'\n\n||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_falsifier_scaled": 5.5, "matrix_falsifier_normalized": 25.0, "step_metadata": {"execution_id": "3ce8356c-694f-4a7d-818c-41a9014c342e", "workflow_id": "workflow_courtroom_20_full_audit", "step_id": "step_falsifier", "initiator_id": "system", "timestamp_isot": "2026-03-14T18:01:11.872773+00:00", "unix_time": 1773511271, "v2_engine": true}, "_audit_signature": "step_falsifier:3ce8356c-694f-4a7d-818c-41a9014c342e:1773511271", "_step_metadata": {"micro_strictness_levels": {"block_rule4": 100, "block_protocol1": 100, "block_globalcontext": 100, "block_headermandates": 100, "block_mandate5": 100, "block_headerrules": 100, "block_rule5": 100, "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding": 100, "block_instructionnohallucination": 100, "block_instructionlanguage_dynamic": 100, "block_headerinstructions": 100, "block_instruction_strictness": 100, "matrix_falsifier": 100, "block_taskfalsifier": 100, "block_rule_falsification_first": 100, "block_role_saboteur": 100, "block_mandate_zerotrust": 100, "block_rule_cognitiverequirement": 100, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 100}}}, "step_profiler": {"matrix_kahneman": 1.0, "matrix_kahneman_justification": "The provided text is a repetitive loop of simple, declarative statements asserting the importance of a project (e.g., \"T\u00e4m\u00e4 on t\u00e4rke\u00e4 hanke\" - \"This is an important project\"). This response is a quintessential example of System 1 thinking. It is fast, automatic, and intuitive, relying on a feeling or a heuristic ('importance') rather than deliberate, analytical thought. There is a complete absence of System 2 engagement; the user does not provide any reasoning, evidence, or analysis to support the claim. The thinking process involves no cognitive strain or consideration of complexity, which is the hallmark of System 1's effortless operation. The repetition does not add analytical depth but merely reinforces the initial intuitive judgment.", "matrix_kahneman_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_kahneman_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility": 1.0, "matrix_epistemic_humility_justification": "The text is composed entirely of absolute and dogmatic assertions, such as \"Hanke on eritt\u00e4in t\u00e4rke\u00e4\" (\"The project is very important\"). These statements are presented as undeniable facts without any qualification, nuance, or acknowledgment of other perspectives. The user demonstrates extreme overconfidence, leaving zero room for interpretation, doubt, or criticism. There is no recognition of any internal or external limitations, risks, or uncertainties associated with the claim of importance. This aligns perfectly with the 'Arrogant/Absolute' score, as the text completely fails to acknowledge the subjective nature of the assessment and instead presents it as an objective truth.||DECIMAL: 1.0||", "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_source_id": null, "matrix_epistemic_humility_cited_text_quote": null, "matrix_kahneman_scaled": 6.0, "matrix_kahneman_normalized": 33.33333333333333, "profiler_metrics": {"word_count": 579, "se